  m_Name: New QR Code Data
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::SafetyTraining.QRCodeData
  qrCodeID: "Haberle\u015Fme Kablosu"
  title: "Haberle\u015Fme Kablosu"
  icon: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 2a19aaadcf7844142a73ce60950ec353, type: 3}
  message: "Bu haberle\u015Fme kablosu, PD (K\u0131smi De\u015Farj) \xF6l\xE7\xFCm
    sisteminde bilgisayar ile saha ekipmanlar\u0131 aras\u0131ndaki veri ileti\u015Fimini
    sa\u011Flamak amac\u0131yla kullan\u0131l\u0131r. \xD6l\xE7\xFCm s\u0131ras\u0131nda
    bilgisayardan al\u0131nan komutlar\u0131n PD kapasit\xF6r\xFCne iletilmesini
    ve elde edilen \xF6l\xE7\xFCm verilerinin g\xFCvenilir \u015Fekilde aktar\u0131lmas\u0131n\u0131
    sa\u011Flar. B\xF6ylece farkl\u0131 PD \xF6l\xE7\xFCm noktalar\u0131yla kesintisiz
    haberle\u015Fme kurularak sistemin do\u011Fru ve verimli \xE7al\u0131\u015Fmas\u0131na
    katk\u0131da bulunur."
